## Integration acceptance

- Test add, update, complete, delete and clear only where supported, including repeated submit and uncertain sync.
- Verify date-only items, timed reminders and completed-item navigation retain their meanings.
- Check keyboard focus after reordering/filtering and distinguish empty results from unavailable data.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

